<title>SLOVAKIA: TENNIS-SLOVAKIA LEAD ISRAEL 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SLOVAKIA LEAD ISRAEL 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia took a 2-0 lead over</p>
<p>Israel after the opening singles of their Davis Cup Euro-African</p>
<p>Zone Group one second round tie on Friday.</p>
<p>Results (Slovak names first):</p>
<p>Dominik Hrbaty beat Eyal Ran 6-3 4-6 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Karol Kucera beat Noam Behr 6-1 6-3 6-0</p>
</text>
